  advanceSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 22330ca217458ad429eca080181d1b8f, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - "Ch\xE0o b\u1EA1n! T\xF4i l\xE0 Haku, nh\xE2n vi\xEAn c\u1EE7a c\xF4ng vi\xEAn
    n\xE0y. R\u1EA5t vui \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\xF3n ti\u1EBFp b\u1EA1n \u0111\u1EBFn
    v\u1EDBi th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi gi\u1EA3i tr\xED k\u1EF3 th\xFA!"
  - "\u0110\u1EA7u ti\xEAn, b\u1EA1n h\xE3y ti\u1EBFn l\u1EA1i Qu\u1EA7y B\xE1n V\xE9
    ngay ph\xEDa tr\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111\u1EC3 nh\u1EADn v\xE9 t\xE0u l\u01B0\u1EE3n
    si\xEAu t\u1ED1c nh\xE9."
  - "Sau khi c\xF3 v\xE9, h\xE3y \u0111i theo bi\u1EC3n ch\u1EC9 d\u1EABn \u0111\u1EBFn
    khu v\u1EF1c \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng ray \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u chuy\u1EBFn
    \u0111i. Ch\xFAc b\u1EA1n c\xF3 nh\u1EEFng ph\xFAt gi\xE2y th\u1EADt tuy\u1EC7t
    v\u1EDDi!"
  currentLineIndex: 0
  isTyping: 0
  currentFullText: 
